KWidgetsAddons bundled source provenance
=========================================

This directory contains a minimal subset of KDE Frameworks KWidgetsAddons,
used by QElectroTech when the bundled minimal KF build is selected.

Upstream project:
  https://invent.kde.org/frameworks/kwidgetsaddons
  Git tag: v6.30.0

The bundled KDE-derived files are the files in this directory whose source
headers identify them as part of the KDE libraries and contain an
SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.0-or-later notice. The bundled subset is:

  include/kabstractcoloredit_p.h
  include/kcolorbutton.h
  include/kcolorcombo.h
  include/kcolormimedata_p.h
  src/kabstractcoloredit.cpp
  src/kcolorbutton.cpp
  src/kcolorcombo.cpp
  src/kcolormimedata.cpp

The following files were added by QElectroTech for the minimal bundled build
and are not part of the KDE Frameworks KWidgetsAddons library:

  CMakeLists.txt
  include/KColorButton
  include/KColorCombo
  include/kwidgetsaddons_export.h

The QElectroTech-added files provide the local CMake target, forwarding
headers, and static-build export definitions needed by this reduced build.
They are covered by the QElectroTech license notices in those files and are
not relicensed KDE code.

The KDE-derived files retain their upstream copyright and license notices.
See licenses/KDE-Frameworks.NOTICE and licenses/KDE-Frameworks.LICENSE in the
QElectroTech source tree.

The full KDE Frameworks library is not included here. This directory contains
only the subset listed above, together with QElectroTech build/support files.
